MID_LGV_1LED_c05_Buc_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c05_Buc_m01_001: The best fighters from all over the empire, all in\nDagsion for the Heroic Games.
MID_LGV_1LED_c05_Buc_m01_002: Milady, I think we should try to strengthen our forces\nhere as well.
MID_LGV_1LED_c05_Buc_m01_003: It wouldn't hurt to hire someone who knows their\nway around a battlefield, as an example.
MID_LGA_1LED_c05_Buc_m01: <BLN>What do you think?
MID_LGV_1LED_c05_Sci_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c05_Sci_m01_001: I've been conducting further investigation into\nLechner on my own.
MID_LGV_1LED_c05_Sci_m01_002: I learned that, of late, the man has been going by\nanother name. Reynold, it's said.
MID_LGV_1LED_c05_Sci_m01_003: That would explain why I had no memory of the\nname "Lechner" when you asked.
MID_LGA_1LED_c05_Sci_m01: <BLN>I learned something.
MID_LGV_1LED_c05_Moo_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c05_Moo_m01_001: Finally, it's time for the match. What do you think\nit'll be like?
MID_LGV_1LED_c05_Moo_m01_002: I'm just dying to get in there! Guess I take after Mom\nlike that.
MID_LGV_1LED_c05_Moo_m01_003: Hey, you don't think—would she be taking part in\nthe Heroic Games? Probably not, right?
MID_LGA_1LED_c05_Moo_m01: <BLN>Itching for the fight!
MID_LGV_1LED_c05_Oly_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c05_Oly_m01_001: Leilidahna, I found this citrus-scented oil at a general\nstore and I put it on.
MID_LGV_1LED_c05_Oly_m01_002: Rather a nice fragrance, don't you think? I'd say it\nsuits me beautifully!
MID_LGV_1LED_c05_Oly_m01_003: <NCA>Politely agree.
MID_LGV_1LED_c05_Oly_m01_004: <NCB>Say you're not sure.
MID_LGV_1LED_c05_Oly_m01_005: <ACA>I knew you'd say so! Naturally, my rival knows\nluxury when she smells it.
MID_LGV_1LED_c05_Oly_m01_006: <ACB>You... What? Well, I thought it was nice.
MID_LGV_1LED_c05_Oly_m01_007: <ACB>Oh dear. You're congested, aren't you?
MID_LGA_1LED_c05_Oly_m01: <BLN>Have you smelled me?
MID_LGV_1LED_c05_Car_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c05_Car_m01_001: A long time has passed since I last sojourned in\nDagsion. I'm not usually one for the city's clamors.
MID_LGV_1LED_c05_Car_m01_002: That's why I spend the bulk of my time at the main\ntemple in Caelus.
MID_LGV_1LED_c05_Car_m01_003: Strangely, though, I don't find the people's\nraucousness here to be quite so grating now.
MID_LGA_1LED_c05_Car_m01: <BLN>Very odd.